1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,882
Transitional epithelium lines the ureter and the urinary bladder.

2
00:00:04,882 --> 00:00:07,317
Its cells can slide over one another.

3
00:00:07,317 --> 00:00:13,541
When the bladder is empty the lining is four or five cells thick with domed surface cells.

4
00:00:13,541 --> 00:00:19,088
As it fills, it stretches to just two or three thin layers.

